        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1 “Ping riu, Ai ni nang lev tat ’chamcna bam de,”",
            "Gaanphiu riw kumc achaeng mi lat {:1 gaanclou;",
            "Zipchwng muangh ding khou hei latryan {:1 tiigaanc;",
            "“Nang ta Ai ’patlou mak, khat sihni ’patlou lak ge.”",
            "",
            "Araana hamh e, .. araana hamh e!",
            "Ata ’patlou lak ge tw e,",
            "Ata ’patlou mak puni;",
            "Araana hamh e,...araana hamh e!",
            "Ata ’patlou lak ge tw e,",
            "Ata ’patlou mak puni.",
            "",
            "2 Mwnpwang guay puangc patna kim key dat kan the,",
            "Kandih neihkhyam keyna zingc key kan sihni,",
            "Jisu Sharon mwnpwang Kamei nunc khang puangc",
            "Jisu tingkauh riw e, ata ganc rulou lak ge.",
            "",
            "3 Theih chaengkhaek {:1 thei-hu padik bam sihni,",
            "Jisu adaeng khou bamna saa e: “Ping riu!”",
            "Lauphunhswan ’ruay guay {:1 neihlaa lu suan kumc",
            "Alung khou suan bam e, “Ata ’patlou mak puni.\""
          ]
        }
      }
